{"id":"the-honeybees-dance","slug":"the-honeybees-dance","title":"The Honeybee's Dance","title_ko":"길을 알려주는 꿀벌의 춤","level":"A2","ageBand":"8-10","coverUrl":"/seed/the-honeybees-dance/cover.webp","summary_ko":"꿀이 많은 꽃밭을 찾은 꿀벌이 춤으로 친구들에게 길을 알려 주는 이야기.","wordCount":184,"pages":[{"id":"the-honeybees-dance-p1","pageNo":1,"spread":"p1","imageUrl":"/seed/the-honeybees-dance/p1.webp","sentences":[{"id":"the-honeybees-dance-p1-s1","ord":0,"text":"Bella the honeybee lived in a busy hive.","translation_ko":"꿀벌 벨라는 바쁜 벌집에서 살았어요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-honeybees-dance/audio/p1-s1.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"Bella","charStart":0,"charEnd":5,"startMs":0,"endMs":500},{"word":"the","charStart":6,"charEnd":9,"startMs":760,"endMs":1000},{"word":"honeybee","charStart":10,"charEnd":18,"startMs":1000,"endMs":1440},{"word":"lived","charStart":19,"charEnd":24,"startMs":2020,"endMs":2040},{"word":"in","charStart":25,"charEnd":27,"startMs":2040,"endMs":2200},{"word":"a","charStart":28,"charEnd":29,"startMs":2200,"endMs":2420},{"word":"busy","charStart":30,"charEnd":34,"startMs":2420,"endMs":2600},{"word":"hive","charStart":35,"charEnd":39,"startMs":2600,"endMs":2920}]},{"id":"the-honeybees-dance-p1-s2","ord":1,"text":"She loved to fly out when the sun was bright.","translation_ko":"햇살이 밝을 때 밖으로 날아가는 걸 좋아했지요.","audioUrl":"/seed/the-honeybees-dance/audio/p1-s2.mp3","wordTimings":[{"word":"She","charStart":0,"charEnd":3,"startMs":0,"endMs":260},{"word":"loved","charStart":4,"charEnd":9,"startMs":260,"endMs":520},{"word":"to","charStart":10,"charEnd":12,"startMs":520,"endMs":1000},{"word":"fly","charStart":13,"charEnd":16,"startMs":1000,"endMs":1020},{"word":"out","charStart":17,"charEnd":20,"startMs":1020,"endMs":1360},{"word":"when","charStart":21,"charEnd":25,"startMs":1360,"endMs":1720},{"word":"the","charStart":26,"charEnd":29,"startMs":1720,"endMs":1940},{"word":"sun","charStart":30,"charEnd":33,"startMs":1940,"endMs":2120},{"word":"was","charStart":34,"charEnd":37,"startMs":2120,"endMs":